INT. DRIVE-IN PROJECTION BOOTH - NIGHT

A cramped room of hot metal and film smell. Two projectors rattle in unison, throwing twin beams through small square windows.

PIA CALLOWAY, 16, in her father's oversized work shirt, threads a reel with quick, careful hands. Beside her, WENDELL OYELARAN, 17, holds a flashlight and a paper sack of popcorn he has no intention of sharing.

He peers over her shoulder. She swats him away without looking.

WENDELL
You're holding it wrong.

PIA
I've held it a hundred times.

WENDELL
Holding it wrong a hundred times.

She grins in spite of herself, then locks the gate. The projector sings. A faint cheer drifts up from the cars below.

An INTERCOM crackles on the wall.

MRS. DUBOIS (O.S.)
(intercom)
Pia, honey, reel two's late. Cars are honking.

PIA
(to the intercom)
Coming up, Mrs. Dubois. Ninety seconds.

MRS. DUBOIS (O.S.)
(intercom)
Ninety seconds is how long the Hendersons will wait before they ask for their dollar back.

She lets go of the button and turns, flustered. He is already holding out the second reel like a dinner plate.

WENDELL
Ninety seconds. I'll count.

PIA
You'll count wrong.

WENDELL
Then count with me.

She takes the reel. He leans in, shoulder to shoulder, so close their flashlights tangle. She does not move away.

PIA
Wend. If this goes wrong, my dad will fire me.

WENDELL
It's your dad's booth.

PIA
That's why.

Together they thread. The leader slips through the rollers, sprockets bite, and she tightens her jaw and he quiets his breathing, both of them staring at the same sliver of film.

MRS. DUBOIS (O.S.)
(intercom)
Sixty seconds.

PIA
We know!

WENDELL
We know!

The changeover cue flashes in the corner of the screen. She thumbs the switch. The first projector dies. The second blazes.

Below, the cars cheer. She exhales. He laughs. They stand there, shaking, two kids on top of the world.

WENDELL (CONT'D)
Best job in the county.

PIA
Worst pay.

WENDELL
Best view.

She looks at him. He is looking at the screen.

On the glass, the light of the film flickers across both faces.
